      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_2.title": "It\u0027s near you",
      "death.attack.dismemberment.item": "%1$s ???",
      "Soul_Collector": "§bClaimed Souls:§d ",
      "item_group.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_itens": "Soul Gauntlet",
      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_6.title": "Absolute Horror ",
      "subtitles.tremblesfx": "",
      "entity.soul_gauntlet.savior": "Savior",
      "key.soul_gauntlet.select_power": "Select Power",
      "Offend": "",
      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_3.title": "You really chose this route? What now? A talking flower?!  ",
      "Description of Offend": "",
      "death.attack.dismemberment": "%1$s lost a part of himself",
      "death.attack.dismemberment.player": "%2$s  Left a part of himself for %1$s",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_remove_powers.button_slot3": "",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_remove_powers.button_slot2": "",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.visual_novel.label_message": "Message",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_interface.label_slot1": "Slot1",
      "Description of Sorry": "",
      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_4.descr": "You have completed Part 1 of the Storyline",
      "item.soul_gauntlet.savior_spawn_egg": "Savior Spawn Egg",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_interface.label_nbtslot1": "%nbt:Slot1%",
      "advancements.soul_gauntlet_achievement.descr": "Thanks for playing!!!",
      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_7.title": "You\u0027re evil, sadistic, a true monster that devours everything in its path… This is why I like you. ",
      "item.soul_gauntlet.soulgem": "Soul Gem",
      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_4.title": "First Act",
      "advancements.soul_gauntlet_achievement.title": "Soul Gauntlet",
      "attribute.soul_gauntlet.evolution_of_souls": "Evolution Of Souls",
      "advancements.soulgauntletachievement_7.descr": "Kill a thousand entities",
      "???": "SOUL SOUL SOUL SOUL ",
      "gamerule.stealChance.description": "Modify chances of gaining skills",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_interface.button_slot2": "",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_interface.button_slot3": "",
      "Speaks out of ignorance": "",
      "item.soul_gauntlet.gauntletblueprint": "Gauntlet Blueprint",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_interface.label_slot2": "Slot2",
      "gui.soul_gauntlet.soul_gauntlet_interface.label_slot3": "Slot3",
      "block.soul_gauntlet.soul_altar": "Soul Altar",
      "Result of Arrogance": "",
      "Savior_History": "\u003cPart\u003d1\u003e§b\u003c???\u003e A human...? It\u0027s been so long since anyone came here...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d2\u003e§b\u003c???\u003e You must be wondering who I am, or what you can loot or kill around here, right? Human.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d3\u003e§b\u003c???\u003e I am Tashia Dolrein. I used to be quite famous, back in the day.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d4\u003e§c\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Before those traitors sealed me away...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d5\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e But I imagine you don’t know me — it has been a looooong time.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d6\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Let’s skip the boring story and all that blah blah blah. I want to make a deal with you, human.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d7\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e I’ll give you the recipe to my power — something that brushes the edge of the divine...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d8\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e It’s just a simple gauntlet. Once you craft it, return to me and I’ll teach you how to enhance it.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d9\u003e§c\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e To become someone as terrifying as I am...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d10\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Good luck, human.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d11\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Welcome back, my dear apprentice...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d12\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Though I can barely see with these eyes carved in stone, I can feel — you trusted me... and forged the gauntlet.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d13\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e But as you’ve likely noticed, it’s still just a shell. Its true power remains dormant...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d14\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e To awaken it, you’ll need to perform certain... sacrifices.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d15\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e After all, the essence of my power is rooted in sacrifice — it feeds on souls to grant your every desire.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d16\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Now... touch me with the gauntlet, and I shall grant you my blessing.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d17\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Very well... Now that I’ve blessed your gauntlet, you are ready to receive the Soul Gem.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d18\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e A special gem that will awaken the gauntlet’s true power. But as I said before... sacrifices will be required.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d19\u003e§c\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Eliminate 100 of those filthy Villagers.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d20\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Until next time, my dear apprentice...\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d21\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Hello again, my dear apprentice.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d22\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e The moment you reaped those 100 wretched souls, I felt a wave of power surge through the stone that binds me.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d23\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e I almost felt my mouth curl into a smile of joy... and then I remembered — I’m a statue.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d24\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Now that you possess the gem, I shall grant you the recipe for the true §6Soul Gauntlet.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d25\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Ah, how quickly you’ve grown... I said I would make a deal, and I kept my word.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d26\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e And what do I want in return? Why... absolutely nothing. Just enjoy the gift I’ve given you.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d27\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Have fun harvesting those trembling, delicious souls... Each one brings you closer to true greatness.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d28\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e And perhaps... brings me closer to mine, too.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e \u003cPart\u003d29\u003e§b\u003cTashia Dolrein\u003e Until we meet again... and of that, I am certain.\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e\u003cPart\u003d30\u003e\u003cPart\u003dEnd\u003e",
      "effect.soul_gauntlet.heavy_eyes": "Heavy Eyes",
